#! ia 1.0

@move Observation
  meaning
    says "Take in what is actually there — the move that reads state without changing it."
    answers "Is this routed to where something is looked at rather than acted on?"
  data
    order 0

@move Execution
  meaning
    says "Carry out the authorized action — the move that changes state."
    answers "Is this routed to where work is performed?"
  data
    order 1

@move Delegation
  meaning
    says "Hand bounded work to another actor — the move that transfers responsibility, not authority."
    answers "Is this routed to where work is given to someone else?"
  data
    order 2

@move Synthesis
  meaning
    says "Combine separate findings into one account — the move that produces a whole from parts."
    answers "Is this routed to where pieces are drawn together?"
  data
    order 3

@move Verification
  meaning
    says "Check a claim against evidence — the move that decides whether something holds."
    answers "Is this routed to where a claim is tested?"
  data
    order 4

